# Upstream modded-nanogpt benchmark logs, not part of the FARO work
records/

# Raw per-step metrics are tracked only for the 12 formal runs, so the report
# can be rebuilt from summary.json. Diagnostic, pilot and smoke runs keep their
# stdout.txt but drop metrics.jsonl.
#
# Note: the opt-in experiment roots FARO/results-sparse, FARO/results-coordonly
# and FARO/results-coordstart are small (tens of MiB) and are the evidence for
# the headline auto-switch claims, so their metrics.jsonl files are tracked in
# full. Current formal FARO numbers come from FARO/results-sparse.
FARO/results/runs/**/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/adam/seed_0/adam-seed0/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/adam/seed_42/adam-seed42/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/adam/seed_1024/adam-seed1024/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/muon/seed_0/muon-seed0/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/muon/seed_42/muon-seed42/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/muon/seed_1024/muon-seed1024/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/normuon/seed_0/normuon-seed0/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/normuon/seed_42/normuon-seed42/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/normuon/seed_1024/normuon-seed1024/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/faro/seed_0/faro-dynamic-explore-freeze-seed0/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/faro/seed_42/faro-dynamic-explore-freeze-seed42/metrics.jsonl
!FARO/results/runs/faro/seed_1024/faro-dynamic-explore-freeze-seed1024/metrics.jsonl

